Package: SIRSsim
Title: SIRS Model Simulator
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Austin", "Melendez", , "austinmelendez@csus.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Austin Melendez [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Austin Melendez <austinmelendez@csus.edu>
Description: Simulates disease spread across grid-based populations with SIR,
    SIS, and SIRS model options. Users can customize infection, immunity, and
    fatality probabilities, set reproducible seeds, and inspect summary or
    per-cell simulation outputs.
URL: https://github.com/austin-mel/sirmodelsimulation
